      "updated": 1665227038300,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SOLUTION?:\n1. Bin of API providers with unique URL/querystring/tags\n\nROUGH IDEA:\n1. Create class that has API shell\n2. Store classes in shelf that becomes bin\n3. Loop through bin to try to then FILL open necessary \nparameters for grading\n    3.1 Parameters = Balance Sheets, Income Statements\n                        Analyst Reviews, Industry, Sector\n4. Once Filled - begin parse \n    4.1 Parse would then have to recognize which type of \n        dataset was pulled and alter the way it parses data",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 315,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SOLUTION?:\n1. Bin of API providers with unique URL/querystring/tags\n\nROUGH IDEA:\n1. Create class that has API shell\n2. Store classes in shelf that becomes bin\n3. Loop through bin to try to then FILL open necessary \nparameters for grading\n    3.1 Parameters = Balance Sheets, Income Statements\n                        Analyst Reviews, Industry, Sector\n4. Once Filled - begin parse \n    4.1 Parse would then have to recognize which type of \n        dataset was pulled and alter the way it parses data"
    },
