      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solution:\n1. Have to detect where the data came from\n2. Create a universal parsing algorithm if \npossible, otherwise \n    2.1 Bin of variable names that can be\n    looped through to pool data and reformat\n3. Other: hardcode the parsing of data \nbased on the format of the dataset",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 191,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Solution:\n1. Have to detect where the data came from\n2. Create a universal parsing algorithm if \npossible, otherwise \n    2.1 Bin of variable names that can be\n    looped through to pool data and reformat\n3. Other: hardcode the parsing of data \nbased on the format of the dataset"
    },
